ator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"title":"Swami","type":"topic"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/contextMenu(_:)":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"contextMenu","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"MenuItems","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"ContextMenu","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI11ContextMenuV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"MenuItems","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">?) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"contextMenu(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/contextmenu(_:)","abstract":[],"deprecated":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/contextMenu(_:)"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Drags a layer in any direction with momentum and rubber-band bounds. The draggable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card responds to touch input via Origami’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.Drag"},{"type":"text","text":" patch, which wires its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"output "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Position"},{"type":"text","text":" to the layer’s transform. When released near the center, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card snaps back to its resting position."}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView","role":"symbol","title":"Interaction_DragView","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","type":"topic"}}}